# Env & secrets
# main/public must never contain secrets. Gitea turnkey env is a tracked .env on the
# private gitea-dev branch (force-added there); never push that branch to GitHub/Gitee.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
secrets/

